      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I made a canny about this already a while about and tracked down what exactly causes this.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/switching-from-a-test-avatar-to-a-normal-one-causes-the-game-to-crash\nIt basically comes down to switching form the uploaded version of the Avatar to the test version and then back to the uploaded version. (all with the same AvatarID)\nBtw this also still happens in the latest open beta.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
