      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm experiencing this crash as well. I see some others here talk about switching from the test version of the avatar to the uploaded version causes the crash, but in my case, it happens whenever I\n1. Am in uploaded avatar X\n2. Switch to test avatar Y\n3. Return to uploaded avatar X\nit doesn't matter what X or Y are. This used to work fine but now happens 100% of the time. I have tried fully reinstalling the game clearing all caches and settings to no avail.\nStrangely, it seems to have started happening after I made a test avatar with \"Foot IK\" enabled in a Locomotion layer state. I never noticed the crash before doing that, but after doing that it's crashing for any test avatar, not just that one. I have no idea how that could be related though.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
