  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "About 75% of the time changing out of an SDK test avatar crashes the game. If it doesn't happen the first time, just change back in and out and it will crash the next time. I only noticed this because that old bug has resurfaced where changing from a test avatar to itself doesn't reload any changes to the avatar, and the workaround is to change to another avatar in between. However lately changing into another avatar between has been crashing pretty consistently.\nI have tried clearing the cache, no effect.\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Change into a test avatar\n2. Change back into a regular avatar\n3. Game crashes\nNot sure but it seems more likely to crash when changing from the test version to the non-test version of the same avatar.\nAlso noticed that the logs mention finding an SDK2 avatar descriptor right before the crash but these are all SDK3, might be of note?\nVRChat Version: \n2021.3.1p1-1114-76a4707828-Release\nOutput Log:\nhttps://gist.github.com/Saberpeep/ad27acdd3dbc25e57e825b1189fc8e04",
